Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/c4pp4/g-unity7

Package: g-unity7-apt-pin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: apt pin for the G Unity⁷ PPA
 Makes apt keep the packages from ppa:c4pp4/g-unity7 even when Ubuntu has a
 newer version, until the PPA releases the matching G Unity⁷ version. Without
 it, a newer Ubuntu version would replace a G Unity⁷ package and its changes.
 .
 Packages that are not in the PPA are not affected.
 .
 The PPA's Firefox and Thunderbird packages are kept only after
 g-unity7-cleanup has installed them instead of the Ubuntu snaps.
